sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as Client (Webhook Sender)
    participant E as Edge (webhook-receiver)
    participant DB as DB RPC (workflow_intake_webhook)
    participant W as Workflow Engine
    participant O as Observability

    C->>E: HTTP POST /webhook-receiver (JSON + headers)
    Note right of E: parse body, normalize headers
    E->>DB: workflow_intake_webhook(token, headers, raw, payload)
    DB->>DB: Token/HMAC policy check (settings)
    DB->>DB: JSON schema validation (mapping_configs)
    DB->>DB: Idempotency (replay detection)
    alt Duplicate replay
        DB-->>E: { status: 200, body: replayed, outcome: response_replayed }
        E->>O: log response event + processing_time_ms
        E-->>C: 200 OK (replayed)
    else New intake
        DB->>W: start_workflow_run(...) (idempotent)
        DB-->>E: { status: 200, body: accepted, outcome: response_sent }
        E->>O: log response event + processing_time_ms
        E-->>C: 200 OK { status: "accepted" }
        Note over W: Workflow continues asynchronously
    end
